WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 5]

01:34.780 --> 01:36.720
Shut the business down
for the time being.

01:37.800 --> 01:39.140
You calm the ladies down.

01:39.460 --> 01:41.760
Once I return to the Capital properly,
I will help them.

01:41.780 --> 01:42.860
All right.

01:43.100 --> 01:43.880
By the way,

01:43.900 --> 01:45.520
there is this lady
with the surname Jin here.

01:45.540 --> 01:46.520
Look after her well.

01:46.540 --> 01:48.140
Return the indenture to her.

01:50.540 --> 01:52.140
Is this fair to Wan'er?

01:52.700 --> 01:54.080
The business is doing quite well.

01:54.100 --> 01:56.340
Do you really want to close it down?

01:56.900 --> 01:57.960
I dare not continue.

01:57.980 --> 01:59.240
Aren't you intrepid?

01:59.260 --> 02:00.860
I wouldn't cross the boundary.

02:00.900 --> 02:01.980
Well.

02:02.060 --> 02:03.500
I should get going.

02:03.600 --> 02:05.540
You should rejoin the diplomatic corps
as soon as possible.

02:05.540 --> 02:07.980
Don't delay their return to the Capital.

02:08.220 --> 02:09.120
I will.

02:09.140 --> 02:10.300
Your Highness,

02:10.340 --> 02:12.440
please send someone

02:12.460 --> 02:13.880
to take care of the Tengs.

02:13.900 --> 02:15.260
Don't worry.

02:17.140 --> 02:18.600
How are you going

02:18.620 --> 02:19.340
to deal with Chengze...

02:19.340 --> 02:20.820
I will get to the bottom of it.

02:22.140 --> 02:23.220
Good, then.

02:23.500 --> 02:26.040
We will expect news
from Shijia Town in the next few days.

02:26.060 --> 02:27.320
Well, enough said.

02:27.340 --> 02:28.860
Once you return to the Capital,

02:29.140 --> 02:30.580
let's achieve big things.

02:35.780 --> 02:37.140
Goodbye, Your Highness.

02:43.580 --> 02:46.640
Xian, you must listen to me.

02:46.660 --> 02:48.780
The Crown Prince and the Second Prince

02:48.780 --> 02:50.160
are locking horns.

02:50.180 --> 02:51.440
Let's not meddle in it.

02:51.460 --> 02:53.200
Your head could be lopped off.

02:53.220 --> 02:54.900
It's not your head, though.

02:55.900 --> 02:57.640
None of us should die, anyway.

02:57.660 --> 02:59.560
It was a big mess in the Capital

02:59.580 --> 03:01.220
upon receiving the news
of your death last time.

03:01.220 --> 03:03.320
It was an uproar. Many people came
to our residence bearing gifts.

03:03.320 --> 03:05.000
Don't make us experience that again.

03:05.140 --> 03:06.120
When I come back here,

03:06.140 --> 03:07.560
return all those things.

03:07.580 --> 03:09.020
They won't take them.

03:09.380 --> 03:10.440
Why not?

03:10.460 --> 03:11.900
Mr. Fan, think about this.

03:12.020 --> 03:13.320
If you are not dead,

03:13.340 --> 03:15.980
no one dares to take back the gifts.

03:16.020 --> 03:17.160
If you are alive,

03:17.180 --> 03:19.920
those street smarts
will probably send more gifts.

03:19.940 --> 03:21.980
You are never fit to be a bureaucrat.

03:24.340 --> 03:25.440
This is nonsense.

03:25.460 --> 03:27.040
Not at all.

03:27.060 --> 03:29.140
This is the bureaucracy

03:29.340 --> 03:31.420
and customary diplomacy.

03:32.180 --> 03:34.120
Well, shut down the business.

03:34.140 --> 03:35.320
Everything is taken care of now.

03:35.340 --> 03:36.420
We are leaving.

03:38.020 --> 03:39.300
Xian, don't go yet.

03:39.460 --> 03:40.760
What do you mean, "everything"?

03:40.780 --> 03:42.000
What about this one?

03:42.020 --> 03:43.400
What should we do with him?

03:43.420 --> 03:44.440
You will take care of him.

03:44.460 --> 03:45.340
Me?

03:45.340 --> 03:47.520
You knocked him out with a hand strike.

03:47.540 --> 03:48.700
What else could I do?

03:48.780 --> 03:50.220
Let him witness

03:50.220 --> 03:51.820
how his two brothers fight?

03:54.060 --> 03:55.640
You are quite considerate.

03:55.660 --> 03:57.840
You are my brother. You should help me.

03:57.860 --> 03:58.980
What about me?

04:02.180 --> 04:05.140
From now on, lock yourself up at home.

04:05.340 --> 04:07.460
Don't leave home before I come back.

04:07.660 --> 04:08.440
All right.

04:08.460 --> 04:10.320
Don't tell anyone
about what happened today.

04:10.340 --> 04:11.420
I know.

04:11.980 --> 04:13.880
Don't worry.
Everything will be all right.

04:13.900 --> 04:14.640
Wait for me.

04:14.660 --> 04:15.820
I will wait for you.

04:16.180 --> 04:17.460
Take care, Young Master.

04:26.380 --> 04:27.980
Making a living isn't easy.

05:12.140 --> 05:13.860
I was supposed to be on this table.

05:16.700 --> 05:17.780
Sizhe.

05:18.260 --> 05:19.340
Sizhe.

05:22.380 --> 05:23.700
Why are you asleep?

05:25.940 --> 05:28.460
Perhaps I'm still growing,
and I get sleepy easily.

05:31.020 --> 05:32.140
It shouldn't be.

05:33.020 --> 05:35.680
I remember that someone was in this room

05:35.700 --> 05:38.540
who came out of nowhere
and knocked me out.

05:38.700 --> 05:41.780
Then, I was lying here.

05:42.700 --> 05:43.860
Impossible.

05:44.060 --> 05:45.560
You said someone from that corner

05:45.580 --> 05:46.340
hand-stroked you,

05:46.340 --> 05:48.300
and you laid on the table.

05:49.900 --> 05:51.020
Seems like it.

05:51.460 --> 05:52.480
Impossible.

05:52.500 --> 05:54.240
You seemed strange
when you came in here.

05:54.260 --> 05:56.680
You went straight to the bed.

05:56.700 --> 05:59.540
You said you were tired
and wanted to take a nap.

05:59.700 --> 06:00.920
I think you had a dream.

06:00.940 --> 06:02.300
A dream?

06:05.140 --> 06:06.700
Sizhe, what happened to your eye?

06:07.260 --> 06:08.420
A donkey kicked me.

06:08.500 --> 06:09.920
A donkey? You have a donkey?

06:09.940 --> 06:11.980
No. I dreamed of it.

06:12.180 --> 06:15.340
A donkey kicked me in my dream.

06:16.340 --> 06:17.760
You had an interesting dream.

06:17.780 --> 06:18.140
I know.

06:18.140 --> 06:20.300
I also dreamed
of two dogs fighting here.

06:21.260 --> 06:24.540
Well, let's continue with the songs.

06:25.620 --> 06:26.800
Chengping, listen.

06:26.820 --> 06:27.960
We are not listening to songs today.

06:27.960 --> 06:29.680
You should return to the palace
and take a good rest.

06:29.680 --> 06:30.560
Why?

06:30.580 --> 06:32.880
Recently, our mental state
has been in poor condition.

06:32.900 --> 06:33.360
Right?

06:33.380 --> 06:34.960
We have a lot of dreams.

06:34.980 --> 06:36.360
I was kicked by a donkey in my dream.

06:36.380 --> 06:38.000
And you were
knocked out by Fan Xian, right?

06:38.020 --> 06:39.100
Fan Xian?

06:39.700 --> 06:41.560
I mean, a bad guy knocked you out
in your dream.

06:41.580 --> 06:42.160
Right?

06:42.180 --> 06:43.780
So, let's call it a day.

06:50.060 --> 06:51.140
Mr. Fan,

06:51.260 --> 06:52.340
they are not here.

06:53.380 --> 06:54.460
Where...

06:54.580 --> 06:55.920
Where did they go?

06:55.940 --> 06:58.000
If the Second Prince didn't seize them,

06:58.020 --> 06:59.240
where could they go?

06:59.260 --> 07:01.100
Did you offend anyone here?

07:01.620 --> 07:03.420
While I was away
for the past six months,

07:03.580 --> 07:05.800
there might be some monetary conflicts.

07:05.820 --> 07:08.100
But it wouldn't get the family involved.

07:08.820 --> 07:11.340
Mr. Fan, you have to return
to the diplomatic corps by yourself.

07:11.380 --> 07:13.360
I'm sorry. I can't accompany you.

07:13.380 --> 07:14.680
I need to go searching for them.

07:14.700 --> 07:15.920
I will go with you.

07:15.940 --> 07:17.260
Mr. Fan, you have to leave

07:17.260 --> 07:18.120
before it's too late.

07:18.140 --> 07:20.020
Don't worry. They are more important.

07:22.940 --> 07:24.340
Dear.

07:26.620 --> 07:27.920
You were inside?

07:27.940 --> 07:29.020
Where is Baba?

07:31.380 --> 07:33.100
Why did you avoid me?

07:33.500 --> 07:35.100
I'm wiping your sweat.

07:35.180 --> 07:36.880
Why nervous?

07:36.900 --> 07:38.120
We were inside the room.

07:38.140 --> 07:39.660
I was putting her to sleep.

07:39.780 --> 07:41.780
But I didn't see you.

07:42.380 --> 07:43.460
Then,

07:43.580 --> 07:45.540
why did you disappear?

07:46.340 --> 07:47.660
Someone took us away.

07:47.700 --> 07:49.040
What do you mean?

07:49.060 --> 07:50.040
We were protected.

07:50.060 --> 07:51.220
Protect?

07:53.580 --> 07:54.120
Who?

07:54.140 --> 07:55.540
Who else could it be?

08:02.900 --> 08:04.020
Chen Pingping?

08:04.780 --> 08:05.900
Exactly.

08:06.260 --> 08:08.660
Mr. Chen wants me
to relay a message to you.

08:08.900 --> 08:10.560
The Tengs have been released.

08:10.580 --> 08:13.160
He will escort them
to Danzhou to settle down.

08:13.180 --> 08:14.560
He asks you

08:14.580 --> 08:16.780
if you would want to meet them
before they depart.

08:18.140 --> 08:19.220
No.

08:19.340 --> 08:21.860
The farther I stay from them,
the safer they can be.

08:23.140 --> 08:26.020
Mr. Chen advises you to return
to the diplomatic corps quickly.

08:26.780 --> 08:28.220
What actually does he want?

08:30.180 --> 08:31.560
Mr. Chen says

08:31.580 --> 08:33.080
that you might be wary of him

08:33.100 --> 08:34.940
after the trip to Northern Qi.

08:35.020 --> 08:36.640
But he won't explain himself

08:36.660 --> 08:39.020
because words are meaningless sometimes.

08:39.420 --> 08:41.020
How he treats you

08:41.100 --> 08:42.820
depends not on his words

08:42.900 --> 08:45.660
but on his actions.

08:50.020 --> 08:51.380
Can you see through him?

08:51.900 --> 08:54.780
I doubt anyone in this world can.

08:57.540 --> 08:58.620
Dear,

08:58.780 --> 09:00.120
thank you for looking after Baba.

09:00.140 --> 09:02.540
Mr. Fan and I should rejoin
the diplomatic corps now.

09:05.540 --> 09:08.380
Mr. Fan, where are you?

09:08.780 --> 09:11.240
We are reaching the Capital soon.

09:11.260 --> 09:14.260
Hurry back, or I will be exposed.

09:38.780 --> 09:39.900
Did you see that?

09:40.780 --> 09:41.500
This fellow

09:41.500 --> 09:43.780
talks to Fan Xian's ashes every day.

09:44.140 --> 09:46.180
I can't hear what he's talking about.

09:46.420 --> 09:47.900
But I'm truly impressed

09:48.100 --> 09:49.820
by his loyalty.

09:50.660 --> 09:52.760
Where are you now?

09:52.780 --> 09:54.540
I'm going crazy.

10:03.660 --> 10:04.740
Well,

10:05.020 --> 10:06.660
the corps is reaching the Capital.

10:07.020 --> 10:08.520
Fan Xian's death

10:08.540 --> 10:10.300
is confirmed.

10:12.140 --> 10:13.080
Let's go

10:13.100 --> 10:14.660
and report to His Highness.

10:47.740 --> 10:49.120
He hasn't been out for days?

10:49.140 --> 10:51.380
Yes, we delivered the meals to his room.

10:51.620 --> 10:53.200
Is he sick?

10:53.220 --> 10:54.600
He eats a lot.

10:54.620 --> 10:56.720
We also prepared yogurt for him.

10:56.740 --> 10:58.080
With fruits.

10:58.100 --> 11:00.360
He doesn't look unwell.

11:00.380 --> 11:02.140
Is anyone else in the room?

11:02.540 --> 11:03.780
No.

11:03.980 --> 11:05.180
You won't know.

11:05.500 --> 11:07.120
Boys at this age

11:07.140 --> 11:08.900
could do anything.

11:10.260 --> 11:11.880
Give that to me. You may go.

11:11.900 --> 11:13.100
Yes.

11:33.900 --> 11:35.940
Mother, do you want to come in?

11:36.780 --> 11:38.300
I brought you yogurt.

11:43.980 --> 11:45.820
You can check under the bed.

11:51.420 --> 11:52.940
There is a cabinet over there.

12:05.540 --> 12:06.400
No one here, right?

12:06.420 --> 12:08.400
Then, why do you coop yourself up?

12:08.420 --> 12:09.760
You aren't usually like this.

12:09.780 --> 12:11.620
He won't let me go out.

12:11.860 --> 12:12.940
Who?

12:14.220 --> 12:16.760
No one. I don't want to go out.

12:16.780 --> 12:17.860
Why not?

12:18.300 --> 12:19.500
Are you in trouble?

12:19.780 --> 12:21.020
Stop asking.

12:21.020 --> 12:23.300
I can't go out. That's all.

12:25.220 --> 12:27.900
Do you have a run-in with a girl?

12:28.140 --> 12:30.640
What girl? There is no such girl.

12:30.660 --> 12:32.540
No. Stop guessing.

12:33.500 --> 12:35.500
How long are you going
to stay in your room?

12:38.140 --> 12:39.780
I don't know either.

12:40.540 --> 12:43.420
Perhaps I still have to wait
for a while more.

12:44.100 --> 12:45.620
Are you waiting for someone?

12:46.500 --> 12:48.760
No... No one. Please stop asking.

12:48.780 --> 12:50.200
Enough.

12:50.220 --> 12:51.540
A girl?

12:52.380 --> 12:54.120
I wish it were a girl.

12:54.140 --> 12:55.420
It's a man.

12:59.380 --> 13:00.460
Mother,

13:01.780 --> 13:04.180
did Father

13:04.420 --> 13:06.120
ask about me?

13:06.140 --> 13:07.400
Why would he ask?

13:07.420 --> 13:09.760
I haven't greeted him these days.

13:09.780 --> 13:10.900
Isn't he angry?

13:11.300 --> 13:12.380
No.

13:13.140 --> 13:14.660
He has been in a good mood

13:14.660 --> 13:16.620
since you didn't show up.

13:19.900 --> 13:21.300
I bet he is.

13:22.740 --> 13:24.900
Father has never
had expectations for me.

13:26.260 --> 13:27.600
Oh, my.

13:27.620 --> 13:30.380
I was just kidding.

13:30.540 --> 13:33.140
It's fine. You don't have to comfort me.

13:33.300 --> 13:34.820
Since childhood,

13:35.620 --> 13:37.020
I have always known

13:37.660 --> 13:39.980
that Father is never satisfied
with everything I do.

13:40.740 --> 13:43.140
No matter how well I do,
he thinks I'm useless.

13:47.140 --> 13:48.220
Mother,

13:50.380 --> 13:51.540
if I could never

13:52.220 --> 13:53.600
do one thing in this life

13:53.620 --> 13:56.380
that makes Father proud,

13:57.540 --> 14:00.020
wouldn't my life be a failure?

14:02.900 --> 14:04.360
Sizhe,

14:04.380 --> 14:06.060
he is your father.

14:06.100 --> 14:08.020
It's not that he looks down on you.

14:08.380 --> 14:10.300
He just expects nothing less from you.

14:18.660 --> 14:21.780
So, can you tell me who that guy is?

14:36.140 --> 14:38.280
Mr. Fan, do you feel better?

14:38.300 --> 14:39.760
It's not serious.

14:39.780 --> 14:41.480
Why can it not be serious?

14:41.500 --> 14:43.640
Since the battle
where Xiao En was captured,

14:43.660 --> 14:45.640
the Dominant Qi in your body

14:45.660 --> 14:47.080
has been out of control.

14:47.100 --> 14:49.000
Fortunately, I found this carriage

14:49.020 --> 14:50.860
so you can rest well.

14:50.880 --> 14:52.820
If not, you would be
coughing up blood again.

14:56.620 --> 14:58.040
The confirmed death of Fan Xian

14:58.060 --> 15:00.300
has relieved His Highness
of his biggest concern.

15:00.380 --> 15:02.780
After returning to the Capital,
I will commend you all.

15:05.500 --> 15:08.260
It's a shame that he is reduced to ashes.

15:08.860 --> 15:11.420
If not, we could reassure His Highness

15:12.260 --> 15:13.480
by showing Fan Xian's body.

15:13.500 --> 15:14.660
That's enough.

15:14.800 --> 15:16.780
How much longer
until we reunite with the corps?

15:16.800 --> 15:18.480
We should be able to catch up with them

15:18.500 --> 15:20.140
before dark.

15:29.540 --> 15:30.760
I need some fresh air.

15:30.780 --> 15:32.260
Just stay inside.

15:40.980 --> 15:42.140
Fan Xian?

15:44.140 --> 15:45.240
What a surprise.

15:45.260 --> 15:46.740
It truly is a surprise.

15:47.620 --> 15:50.620
Xie Bi'an, I have already died for days.
You still follow the diplomatic corps.

15:50.620 --> 15:52.220
Are you keeping vigil for me?

15:53.020 --> 15:54.140
Kill him.

15:54.260 --> 15:55.780
Let him die one more time.

15:56.260 --> 15:57.660
Wang, charge!

16:57.980 --> 17:00.020
Mr. Fan, it's a cliff.

17:03.140 --> 17:05.100
Take a chance!

17:37.460 --> 17:38.480
Mr. Fan,

17:38.500 --> 17:39.780
we won.

17:40.300 --> 17:42.780
Thanks for accompanying me all along.
We need to part now.

17:43.180 --> 17:44.260
Go back.

17:51.420 --> 17:53.180
Tell Li Chengze

17:53.460 --> 17:55.260
to wait for me at the Capital.

18:02.660 --> 18:04.300
Mr. Xie, aren't we chasing after them?

18:04.980 --> 18:06.780
It's already close to the Capital.

18:07.060 --> 18:08.860
We can't attack the diplomatic corps.

18:09.580 --> 18:10.660
At this point,

18:12.260 --> 18:14.300
he has come back to life.

18:39.980 --> 18:41.700
Mr. Fan, you are back!

18:42.420 --> 18:43.280
I'm back too.

18:43.300 --> 18:45.060
You are all back. That's great!

18:45.060 --> 18:46.260
What a journey.

18:46.260 --> 18:47.920
Finally, I made it back alive.

18:47.940 --> 18:50.240
Mr. Yan said you wouldn't make it.

18:50.260 --> 18:51.760
What nonsense is he talking about?

18:51.780 --> 18:53.240
Let me smash this first.

18:53.260 --> 18:54.380
Don't.

19:02.660 --> 19:04.100
Whose convoy is that behind?

19:04.420 --> 19:06.100
The Crown Princess of Northern Qi.

19:06.940 --> 19:08.480
The Crown Princess of Northern Qi?

19:08.500 --> 19:09.940
Where did she come from?

19:10.020 --> 19:11.760
They have been following
the diplomatic corps.

19:11.780 --> 19:13.520
Her convoy caught up
right after you guys left.

19:13.540 --> 19:15.640
The young Northern Qi emperor
appointed a marriage alliance

19:15.660 --> 19:16.960
with the Qing State.

19:16.980 --> 19:19.780
They have been urging us to travel fast.

19:19.940 --> 19:21.720
Thanks to Mr. Yan,

19:21.740 --> 19:23.580
we have been able to travel slowly.

19:26.500 --> 19:27.480
Who is she marrying?

19:27.500 --> 19:29.260
First Prince.

19:29.500 --> 19:30.960
First Prince?

19:30.980 --> 19:34.240
Isn't he always fighting in the battles?

19:34.260 --> 19:35.780
How can he get married?

20:35.450 --> 20:37.845
[Second Prince's Residence]

20:40.820 --> 20:42.520
Chengru is returning to the Capital?

20:42.540 --> 20:44.660
A new commander took over
his duty at the border.

20:44.860 --> 20:48.020
The First Prince only brought
his personal guards back.

20:48.700 --> 20:51.620
Why is he suddenly transferred back
after so many years?

20:54.260 --> 20:55.940
It's said that he is getting married.

20:56.780 --> 21:01.060
The Crown Princess of Northern Qi
is going to marry the First Prince.

21:15.340 --> 21:17.540
Is he going to take the plunge?

21:18.060 --> 21:19.780
After all, he marries a princess.

21:20.820 --> 21:22.680
When will Chengru arrive in the Capital?

21:23.300 --> 21:24.740
In two days.

21:25.340 --> 21:28.180
They are preparing
to welcome him outside the city.

21:28.500 --> 21:30.060
That's good.

21:31.820 --> 21:33.860
But he might run into Fan Xian there.

21:36.940 --> 21:38.020
How so?

21:38.820 --> 21:40.500
I calculated the timing.

21:40.980 --> 21:43.540
The diplomatic corps Fan Xian being in
and the First Prince

21:43.540 --> 21:45.100
should arrive on the same day.

21:45.340 --> 21:46.680
What a coincidence.

21:46.700 --> 21:49.300
By right, they should enter
through two different city gates.

21:50.420 --> 21:54.020
But if they enter through the same gate,
who do you think will make way?

21:56.420 --> 21:57.620
Pass my order.

21:57.660 --> 21:59.460
Be it a coincidence or a roadwork,

21:59.460 --> 22:01.380
make sure they

22:01.980 --> 22:03.700
use the same city gate.

22:19.375 --> 22:20.660
[Miss Shen, sister of Shen Zhong
of Northern Qi]

22:20.660 --> 22:21.780
Fan Xian?

22:27.180 --> 22:29.220
You guys get along quite well.

22:29.940 --> 22:31.540
You can't be serious.

22:31.780 --> 22:33.320
Can't you see who is being chained?

22:33.340 --> 22:34.200
I did.

22:34.220 --> 22:35.220
What is this supposed to mean?

22:35.240 --> 22:36.220
She isn't from the Qing State.

22:36.220 --> 22:37.480
How could I not be cautious?

22:37.500 --> 22:40.300
Why don't you just kill her
instead of guarding her every day?

22:41.940 --> 22:43.220
Killing her

22:43.500 --> 22:44.760
won't do me any good.

22:44.780 --> 22:46.060
Nor harm.

22:47.480 --> 22:48.860
Stop deluding yourself.

22:50.580 --> 22:51.920
Why did you come back here?

22:51.940 --> 22:52.960
What a question.

22:52.980 --> 22:54.480
My fake death is over.

22:54.500 --> 22:56.020
It's time to come back to life.

22:57.660 --> 22:59.020
You won't.

23:10.881 --> 23:13.308
[Qing]

23:34.300 --> 23:34.960
Mr. Gao.

23:34.980 --> 23:36.060
Mr. Gao.

23:39.580 --> 23:40.740
Wang.

23:42.180 --> 23:43.260
I'm here.

23:45.060 --> 23:45.920
Take this.

23:45.940 --> 23:46.720
What is this for?

23:46.740 --> 23:47.820
Just take it.

23:48.060 --> 23:49.700
Do you have something to ask of me?

23:49.860 --> 23:51.240
We are buddies.

23:51.260 --> 23:52.620
You don't have to do this.

23:55.500 --> 23:57.780
Are these Northern Qi's silver taels?

23:57.940 --> 23:58.560
How did you know?

23:58.580 --> 23:59.980
They smell different.

24:00.700 --> 24:01.780
Gao,

24:02.300 --> 24:04.760
why are you giving me money?

24:04.780 --> 24:06.020
To compensate you.

24:06.820 --> 24:07.480
To compensate me?

24:07.500 --> 24:08.280
What for?

24:08.300 --> 24:10.080
Did you break my things?

24:10.100 --> 24:11.260
No.

24:11.380 --> 24:12.560
I'm paying for your clothes.

24:12.580 --> 24:14.340
You left in haste last time

24:14.340 --> 24:16.960
and had left some clothes here.

24:16.980 --> 24:18.380
Did you lose them?

24:18.460 --> 24:19.980
But they wouldn't cost

24:19.980 --> 24:21.760
this much.

24:21.780 --> 24:23.240
How would the clothes get lost

24:23.260 --> 24:25.380
under my watch?

24:25.780 --> 24:27.260
If it's not,

24:27.300 --> 24:28.980
then why are you paying me?

24:30.500 --> 24:31.920
Someone bought them.

24:31.940 --> 24:33.300
Someone bought them?

24:33.860 --> 24:35.260
Do those old clothes

24:35.260 --> 24:36.960
sell for this much money?

24:36.980 --> 24:38.300
You weren't there.

24:38.780 --> 24:40.640
Every time the diplomatic corps
passed a town,

24:40.660 --> 24:42.240
the place was swarmed with people.

24:42.260 --> 24:43.580
Swarmed?

24:43.740 --> 24:45.240
Did they gather to collect old clothes?

24:45.260 --> 24:48.100
Enough about old clothes.

24:48.460 --> 24:50.500
They came to mourn for Mr. Fan.

24:50.660 --> 24:54.860
Mr. Fan!

25:00.700 --> 25:02.800
Everyone rushed to the carriage

25:02.820 --> 25:05.220
as they thought the diplomatic corps
was the last place Mr. Fan had been.

25:05.240 --> 25:06.180
They were begging in tears,

25:06.180 --> 25:07.740
saying that they wanted
Mr. Fan's clothes

25:07.740 --> 25:09.100
as memorabilia.

25:09.180 --> 25:11.240
The news of his death
really spread so far.

25:11.260 --> 25:12.240
I thought

25:12.260 --> 25:14.780
it would only spread in the Capital.

25:15.100 --> 25:18.220
Not only in the Capital,
but the entire Qing State also knows

25:18.300 --> 25:19.560
you are dead.

25:19.580 --> 25:20.760
This doesn't make sense.

25:20.780 --> 25:21.940
Of course.

25:21.960 --> 25:24.400
It's the publicity campaign
of the Imperial Inspectorate.

25:25.500 --> 25:27.020
What is a publicity campaign?

25:27.460 --> 25:29.540
Someone behind is doing propaganda.

25:30.060 --> 25:31.260
The Imperial Inspectorate alone

25:31.260 --> 25:33.020
isn't able to achieve this.

25:33.220 --> 25:34.780
It's His Majesty.

25:35.500 --> 25:37.560
But His Majesty knows that I'm alive.

25:37.580 --> 25:39.320
Why would he disseminate
news of my death?

25:39.340 --> 25:42.300
His Majesty always considers
the greater good.

25:42.620 --> 25:44.960
So, the motive behind
disseminating news of my death

25:44.980 --> 25:46.540
is for the sake of the Qing State?

25:47.100 --> 25:49.000
It's all for the sake of the Qing State.

25:49.020 --> 25:51.500
If my death benefits the Qing State,

25:52.740 --> 25:55.620
why don't you make it a real one?

26:16.420 --> 26:17.120
What do you want?

26:17.140 --> 26:18.920
I must stay alive
and return to the Capital.

26:18.940 --> 26:21.260
I need to investigate
Li Chengze's thoroughly.

26:21.780 --> 26:22.960
It's not that I want to kill you,

26:22.980 --> 26:24.200
but you simply must die.

26:24.220 --> 26:25.340
I understand.

26:25.980 --> 26:29.300
Unless my fake death has a reasonable

26:29.780 --> 26:31.220
and valid reason,

26:31.240 --> 26:33.260
I will be considered
deceiving the emperor.

26:33.660 --> 26:37.480
It would be best if I could also verify

26:37.500 --> 26:38.940
the literary succession.

26:39.340 --> 26:40.780
How could it be possible?

26:42.360 --> 26:45.040
Is the Crown Princess of Northern Qi
also in the diplomatic corps?

26:46.180 --> 26:47.160
What are you planning?

26:47.180 --> 26:48.300
What is she like?

26:48.340 --> 26:50.300
Just a princess.

27:01.820 --> 27:03.280
It's already late.

27:03.300 --> 27:05.180
Mr. Yan, why do you...

27:17.500 --> 27:18.720
Fan... Fan...

27:18.740 --> 27:20.020
Fan... Fan Xian.

27:20.500 --> 27:22.300
Aren't you already dead?

27:22.860 --> 27:24.380
Have you seen me before?

27:28.740 --> 27:30.780
Secretly.

27:32.340 --> 27:33.920
I'm more surprised than you are.

27:33.940 --> 27:35.400
What do you mean, "secretly"?

27:35.420 --> 27:37.340
During Mother's birthday banquet.

27:37.500 --> 27:38.780
In the back hall.

27:38.860 --> 27:40.580
I saw

27:40.700 --> 27:43.540
you and the Holy Maiden of Northern Qi,
Miss Duoduo,

27:43.780 --> 27:46.220
looking at each other affectionately

27:46.420 --> 27:48.200
in front of everyone.

27:48.220 --> 27:50.300
No! Not affectionate!

27:51.260 --> 27:52.580
Are you that nervous?

27:54.660 --> 27:56.020
Pick it up.

27:59.100 --> 28:01.620
Emissary Fan, are you

28:02.340 --> 28:04.180
not dead enough?

28:05.060 --> 28:06.700
It isn't a real death.

28:10.500 --> 28:11.780
Not a real death.

28:22.460 --> 28:23.780
All right.

28:25.020 --> 28:26.260
Back to your position.

28:40.300 --> 28:41.995
[Crown Princess of Northern Qi]

28:42.020 --> 28:44.180
When I first heard of your death,

28:44.260 --> 28:45.820
I was shocked.

28:46.020 --> 28:47.380
Now

28:47.420 --> 28:49.780
that I see you are safe,

28:50.260 --> 28:52.980
I feel rather relieved.

28:53.460 --> 28:56.020
Fortunately, we didn't
lose a great talent.

28:58.540 --> 29:01.040
Do you not go out much, Your Highness?

29:01.060 --> 29:02.860
I'm a princess.

29:03.340 --> 29:05.780
How could I leave the palace casually?

29:06.500 --> 29:08.540
Got it. That's why you are nervous.

29:09.260 --> 29:10.740
As the Qi royal,

29:10.820 --> 29:12.540
we must be composed

29:12.820 --> 29:14.540
whenever we are.

29:15.060 --> 29:16.540
We won't be nervous.

29:20.020 --> 29:21.780
All right, got it.

29:21.980 --> 29:24.300
Your Highness,
let's talk about something serious.

29:25.060 --> 29:26.580
Before you departed,

29:27.220 --> 29:29.000
what did the Emperor
and the Empress Dowager

29:29.020 --> 29:30.580
inform you?

29:34.700 --> 29:36.100
You may leave.

29:47.020 --> 29:49.780
Mother and His Majesty told me

29:50.220 --> 29:52.300
that you and the Qi State

29:52.500 --> 29:54.780
had a secret smuggling deal.

29:55.740 --> 29:58.760
If you have any news in the future,

29:58.780 --> 30:00.260
you can inform me,

30:00.580 --> 30:03.040
and I will pass it on to Qi.

30:03.060 --> 30:05.540
So, we are on the same side.

30:07.020 --> 30:08.680
Maybe.

30:08.700 --> 30:10.000
That's why I can't die.

30:10.020 --> 30:11.240
You are not dead.

30:11.260 --> 30:12.780
But I can't stay alive either.

30:12.820 --> 30:14.340
If I can't stay alive,

30:14.500 --> 30:16.780
how can we continue our deal?

30:17.580 --> 30:18.660
If so,

30:19.300 --> 30:21.380
how can you keep yourself alive?

30:21.980 --> 30:23.980
Do you lie, Your Highness?

30:26.260 --> 30:27.780
The Qi royal

30:28.220 --> 30:29.280
values integrity.

30:29.300 --> 30:31.400
We never commit dishonesty.

30:31.420 --> 30:34.180
But if you don't lie,

30:34.940 --> 30:39.540
you might fail the task
your Mother and the Emperor gave you.

30:44.740 --> 30:45.820
Still,

30:46.540 --> 30:48.540
I don't know how to lie.

30:49.940 --> 30:51.540
Don't worry.

30:52.340 --> 30:54.060
It's simple.

30:54.220 --> 30:55.740
I will teach you.

30:56.800 --> 30:59.020
[Qi]

31:17.780 --> 31:19.180
What has happened?

31:19.540 --> 31:21.060
What is going on?

31:26.300 --> 31:27.860
Congratulations, everyone.

31:28.020 --> 31:30.400
You have finally escaped
the grave danger.

31:30.420 --> 31:32.180
Grave danger?

31:32.980 --> 31:34.400
While the diplomatic corps left Qi

31:34.420 --> 31:36.300
and entered the land of the Qing State,

31:36.460 --> 31:38.080
someone had been following us

31:38.100 --> 31:39.460
and spying on us.

31:39.480 --> 31:41.540
Your Highness,
you are exaggerating the danger.

31:42.020 --> 31:43.620
Ever since the diplomatic corps
entered the Qing State,

31:43.620 --> 31:44.950
we have been under military protection.

31:44.950 --> 31:46.200
No one dares to attack us.

31:46.220 --> 31:47.580
Still, there is someone,

31:48.020 --> 31:51.820
even a legion, who can't stop.

31:52.220 --> 31:53.740
Could it be the Grandmaster?

31:55.820 --> 31:56.340
Exactly.

31:56.340 --> 31:57.280
Grandmaster?

31:57.300 --> 31:58.780
Grandmaster?

31:59.340 --> 32:02.780
Grandmaster
is more powerful than an army.

32:02.780 --> 32:05.980
In this case, why did
the Grandmaster attack us?

32:07.820 --> 32:10.840
Before Mr. Zhuang Mohan's pass,

32:10.860 --> 32:15.340
he entrusted Mr. Fan Xian
with his important collection.

32:15.460 --> 32:16.480
What does that symbolize?

32:16.500 --> 32:19.760
It symbolizes the literary succession.

32:19.780 --> 32:20.860
Precisely.

32:21.260 --> 32:23.760
Literary talents only emerge
between our two states.

32:23.780 --> 32:26.680
What would others think?

32:26.700 --> 32:29.020
That's right.

32:29.060 --> 32:30.780
It must be the foreign barbarian clan.

32:30.940 --> 32:32.340
It's Dongyi City.

32:34.700 --> 32:37.760
Your Highness, how did you know
about Grandmaster?

32:37.780 --> 32:39.520
I saw

32:39.540 --> 32:41.220
someone from the diplomatic corps

32:41.340 --> 32:45.020
confront the Grandmaster alone.

32:45.100 --> 32:47.000
He risked his own life

32:47.020 --> 32:49.460
to secure the literary succession

32:49.660 --> 32:52.180
and protect your lives.

32:52.340 --> 32:53.680
- Who?
- Who is this person?

32:53.700 --> 32:54.260
I don't know.

32:54.260 --> 32:55.400
It must be an expert.

32:55.420 --> 32:56.700
It must be.

32:56.740 --> 32:59.320
He is brave enough to confront
the Grandmaster alone.

32:59.340 --> 33:00.620
That's Fan Xian.

33:00.780 --> 33:02.380
Don't come closer.

33:03.940 --> 33:04.580
Mr. Fan.

33:04.580 --> 33:05.820
Fan Xian?

33:07.300 --> 33:08.960
Aren't you already dead?

33:08.980 --> 33:10.080
Mr. Fan,

33:10.100 --> 33:11.560
what is going on?

33:11.580 --> 33:12.780
Please tell us.

33:12.780 --> 33:14.240
Right.

33:14.260 --> 33:15.580
Please tell us.

33:20.780 --> 33:21.860
Forget it.

33:22.540 --> 33:23.940
It really doesn't matter.

33:24.980 --> 33:28.100
Mr. Fan doesn't want to take credit.

33:28.260 --> 33:29.400
But all of you

33:29.420 --> 33:31.760
have the right to know the truth.

33:31.780 --> 33:32.720
Qinian, no.

33:32.740 --> 33:34.020
Mr. Fan!

33:35.260 --> 33:36.340
Gentlemen,

33:36.540 --> 33:38.780
when confronting the Grandmaster,

33:38.940 --> 33:42.000
Mr. Fan couldn't do anything
but fake his death.

33:42.020 --> 33:44.760
Only if Mr. Fan died

33:44.780 --> 33:46.560
would the literary succession

33:46.580 --> 33:49.040
be interrupted

33:49.060 --> 33:50.300
and the Grandmaster

33:50.300 --> 33:52.480
wouldn't attack the diplomatic corps.

33:52.500 --> 33:55.840
That's how he protected all of you.

33:55.860 --> 33:59.000
Turns out Mr. Fan faked his death
to protect our lives.

33:59.020 --> 34:00.240
He is doing this for the Qing State.

34:00.260 --> 34:01.060
It's all thanks to him.

34:01.060 --> 34:02.260
It's not worth mentioning.

34:02.260 --> 34:03.340
Right.

34:05.740 --> 34:06.860
Your Highness.

34:09.220 --> 34:10.600
You ran into this incident

34:10.620 --> 34:12.320
by accident.

34:12.340 --> 34:13.400
Thank you

34:13.420 --> 34:14.940
for keeping this secret for me.

34:18.900 --> 34:21.180
Literature greatly concerns
the state itself.

34:22.420 --> 34:24.340
Qi and Southern Qing

34:24.580 --> 34:26.100
should share it.

34:26.620 --> 34:28.140
No one else should
get their hands on it.

34:28.160 --> 34:30.180
- That's right.
- Please be seated, Your Highness.

34:36.780 --> 34:38.260
Here's water.

34:39.580 --> 34:40.920
Mr. Fan,

34:40.940 --> 34:43.620
which Grandmaster you encountered?

34:43.780 --> 34:45.180
We didn't fight.

34:45.340 --> 34:47.700
If the Grandmaster had fought me,

34:48.380 --> 34:50.340
I would have been dead by now.

34:51.380 --> 34:53.620
I only saw from a distance

34:54.540 --> 34:56.260
that the person was using a sword.

34:57.360 --> 34:58.800
Your question seems rather unnecessary.

34:58.820 --> 35:01.680
Who else could it be among the four Grandmasters
except Northern Qi and Qing?

35:01.700 --> 35:02.780
It's Sigu Jian.

35:02.800 --> 35:03.800
I didn't really get a good look.

35:03.820 --> 35:05.760
I don't want to blame the wrong person.

35:05.780 --> 35:08.440
We can't make an accusation
without proof.

35:08.460 --> 35:11.300
What if he comes to seek revenge
for this?

35:12.620 --> 35:13.900
Right.

35:14.860 --> 35:16.680
Thank you, Mr. Fan.

35:16.700 --> 35:20.620
Thank you, Mr. Fan.

35:33.900 --> 35:36.660
For the Qing State all the way.

35:36.740 --> 35:37.420
The Qing State!

35:37.420 --> 35:49.780
The Qing State!

35:49.780 --> 35:51.180
Silence.

35:52.540 --> 35:55.360
You have an hour

35:55.380 --> 35:56.900
to get ready and break camp.

35:57.420 --> 35:58.800
After that,

35:58.820 --> 36:00.300
we will depart without delay.

36:00.860 --> 36:02.240
Knowing that Mr. Fan is in one piece

36:02.260 --> 36:03.360
is a blessing to the Qing State.

36:03.380 --> 36:05.180
Deliver this message back
to the Capital immediately.

36:05.180 --> 36:05.820
Yes.

36:05.820 --> 36:07.340
Yes, Mr. Yan.

36:07.660 --> 36:08.360
Let's go.

36:08.380 --> 36:10.180
Deliver this message back
to the Capital immediately.

36:10.180 --> 36:11.280
Yes.

36:11.300 --> 36:13.820
Mr. Fan is truly a blessing
to the Qing State.

36:14.140 --> 36:15.380
Exactly.

36:27.380 --> 36:29.080
Finally, I came back to life.

36:29.100 --> 36:30.180
Yes, you did.

36:34.820 --> 36:36.060
Mr. Fan,

36:36.780 --> 36:39.820
aren't you afraid
that Sigu Jian will come after you?

36:40.700 --> 36:42.720
If he had to come
for a trivial matter like this,

36:42.740 --> 36:44.260
he would have come already.

36:45.440 --> 36:47.600
Thank you for cooperating with us,
Your Highness.

36:52.900 --> 36:53.880
Mr. Fan,

36:53.900 --> 36:56.720
may I ask you

36:56.740 --> 36:57.760
something?

36:57.780 --> 36:58.860
Ask away.

37:01.260 --> 37:03.780
The two states have a marriage alliance.

37:04.220 --> 37:05.960
Do you know

37:05.980 --> 37:08.500
what the First Prince is like?

37:08.520 --> 37:10.340
The First Prince has been stationed
outside for years.

37:10.340 --> 37:11.800
I have never met him before.

37:23.260 --> 37:26.220
Have you met the First Prince before?

37:26.380 --> 37:27.500
No.

37:32.340 --> 37:33.420
Watch your step.

37:34.740 --> 37:35.980
Mr. Yan.

37:41.900 --> 37:42.980
Thank you.

37:43.540 --> 37:44.680
You died

37:44.700 --> 37:45.940
by my hand,

37:46.340 --> 37:48.380
yet came back to life by my mouth.

37:49.740 --> 37:50.820
Fan Xian,

37:51.700 --> 37:52.900
it won't happen again.

38:24.140 --> 38:25.120
Wang,

38:25.140 --> 38:26.320
there is a man ahead.

38:26.340 --> 38:28.260
Is he here to receive
the diplomatic corps?

38:28.780 --> 38:30.900
How come he is alone?

38:30.940 --> 38:32.900
His face seems familiar.

38:38.900 --> 38:40.780
Mr. Fan!

38:41.060 --> 38:42.940
You are finally back.

38:49.660 --> 38:51.220
Mr. Fan.

39:09.300 --> 39:11.500
Official Xin, do you want
to rest in the carriage?

39:18.140 --> 39:19.500
Official Xin, here you go.

39:21.620 --> 39:22.700
Slowly.

39:25.940 --> 39:26.760
Thanks.

39:26.780 --> 39:27.860
Thanks.

39:31.740 --> 39:32.820
Mr...

39:33.260 --> 39:34.340
Mr. Fan,

39:34.460 --> 39:37.400
you have made contributions
to the state on this trip.

39:37.420 --> 39:40.340
[Xin Qiwu, Vice Minister of the Court of State Ceremonial]
You will probably be promoted.

39:40.340 --> 39:41.860
Congratulations.

39:42.780 --> 39:44.380
By the looks of it,

39:44.740 --> 39:46.780
His Majesty didn't blame me
for deceiving him.

39:48.260 --> 39:49.780
His Majesty didn't say about it.

39:50.340 --> 39:53.100
He asks us to receive
the diplomatic corps.

39:53.340 --> 39:54.240
Thank you, Official Xin.

39:54.260 --> 39:55.860
Should we enter the Capital now?

39:55.980 --> 39:57.140
Um.

39:57.700 --> 39:59.380
The arrival of the diplomatic corps

39:59.580 --> 40:01.180
is on everyone's radar.

40:01.660 --> 40:02.440
Well.

40:02.460 --> 40:05.380
The Ministry of Rites has already
prepared a ceremony.

40:05.740 --> 40:07.140
It's just...

40:07.220 --> 40:07.960
It's just...

40:07.980 --> 40:09.620
What is it? Tell us.

40:10.100 --> 40:11.500
It's coincidental

40:12.060 --> 40:14.560
that the First Prince
returns from the army

40:14.580 --> 40:15.980
today.

40:17.420 --> 40:18.860
What a coincidence.

40:23.180 --> 40:25.700
Supposedly, you could've avoided each other.

40:25.940 --> 40:27.540
Unfortunately,
the official road in the east

40:27.540 --> 40:30.120
was washed away the other day
due to the rising water,

40:30.140 --> 40:32.760
and the First Prince suddenly
changed his schedule.

40:32.780 --> 40:35.120
So, both of you will be using

40:35.140 --> 40:36.340
the north gate.

40:37.580 --> 40:38.780
Where is he now?

40:39.140 --> 40:40.300
He is not far away.

40:40.660 --> 40:42.240
Less than three li from here.

40:42.260 --> 40:43.340
So?

40:43.780 --> 40:47.680
The cavalry guards of the First Prince
will arrive soon.

40:47.700 --> 40:51.580
So, it is not good if both convoys
crowd outside the city?

40:53.580 --> 40:54.320
Exactly.

40:54.340 --> 40:56.980
The Ministry of Rites sends you over
to persuade me to make way.

41:01.980 --> 41:04.140
After all, he is the prince.

41:08.100 --> 41:09.740
Mr. Fan, you have worked hard.

41:10.100 --> 41:11.120
So, you may

41:11.140 --> 41:12.220
take a rest

41:12.220 --> 41:13.400
by the roadside.

41:13.420 --> 41:14.660
Once the First Prince enters the city,

41:14.660 --> 41:16.940
officers of the Ministry of Rites
and the Court of State Ceremonial

41:16.940 --> 41:19.820
will come out of the city
to welcome the diplomatic corps.

41:21.620 --> 41:22.420
You could've sent over

41:22.420 --> 41:24.160
a runner

41:24.180 --> 41:25.320
to inform.

41:25.340 --> 41:27.220
Why did you come here personally?

41:28.820 --> 41:30.620
It's fine.

41:30.740 --> 41:34.320
I have missed you so much.

41:34.340 --> 41:34.920
Look,

41:34.940 --> 41:38.100
I was so excited
that I couldn't sleep last night.

41:38.540 --> 41:40.380
Look at how excited I am
after seeing you.

41:40.380 --> 41:41.760
Tears are bursting out.

41:41.780 --> 41:43.220
Official Xin, stop.

41:43.900 --> 41:45.660
You can cry later.

41:47.260 --> 41:48.240
All right.

41:48.260 --> 41:49.660
I will cry later.

41:49.740 --> 41:51.460
Could you please make way...

41:52.260 --> 41:53.720
This is simple.

41:53.740 --> 41:54.860
Yes.

41:55.580 --> 41:57.060
I can't decide.

41:57.700 --> 42:00.940
Do you know the Crown Princess
of Northern Qi is in the convoy?

42:02.100 --> 42:02.960
I do.

42:02.980 --> 42:04.240
Do you also know

42:04.260 --> 42:07.420
she'll be the First Princess Consort
after the marriage alliance is formed?

42:07.980 --> 42:08.780
I do.

42:08.800 --> 42:09.980
So, should we ask for her permission

42:09.980 --> 42:11.860
to make way?

42:13.740 --> 42:15.260
I don't think this is necessary.

42:15.260 --> 42:16.680
You don't want to let her know?

42:16.700 --> 42:17.840
That's a good idea.

42:17.860 --> 42:19.520
Good. Everyone heard that?

42:19.540 --> 42:21.060
Yes.

42:21.140 --> 42:22.500
It's Official Xin's idea

42:22.520 --> 42:24.600
to keep this from the future
First Princess Consort.

42:24.620 --> 42:26.560
Don't.

42:26.580 --> 42:27.640
Well...

42:27.660 --> 42:29.920
We should ask for her permission.

42:29.940 --> 42:31.020
Sure.

42:31.300 --> 42:32.920
Anything you say, Official Xin.

42:32.940 --> 42:33.840
No.

42:33.860 --> 42:35.320
No, I didn't mean that.

42:35.340 --> 42:36.280
Official Xin.

42:36.300 --> 42:36.880
Please, don't.

42:36.900 --> 42:37.840
Official Xin.

42:37.860 --> 42:40.260
I can't decide on this.

42:40.460 --> 42:42.320
What a weird coincidence.

42:42.340 --> 42:44.260
It's said that he changed his schedule.

42:44.340 --> 42:45.780
He changed his schedule,

42:45.940 --> 42:47.700
and it clashes with mine?

42:47.860 --> 42:50.040
It's said that the princess's carriage

42:50.060 --> 42:52.660
represents the state's dignity.

42:52.780 --> 42:54.120
But I think

42:54.140 --> 42:55.760
both of you are going to be a family.

42:55.780 --> 42:57.600
So, there is no need to argue over this.

42:57.620 --> 42:58.700
Not a problem.

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
